# Forms

- `"use client"` + named exports `function FormName()`.
- Placement: shared → `src/components/forms/<name>/index.tsx`; one route → `src/app/<route>/_components/forms/<name>/index.tsx`.
- Zod schema validation for inputs and DB operations.
- Reuse shared controls — no ad-hoc inputs. Extend with props; do not redesign a parallel form control per page.
- Required: derive from schema (no handmade `*` / "(optional)" text).
- Invalid: `data-invalid`, `aria-invalid`.
- Never duplicate the same form state/submit logic across pages.
